(def-fns _ $ (erased mv-l : (erased (Pk) K) (erased (Mvk) ml mr) (erased (Nat) r) (erased (Kl K ml mr r) kl) (erased (Nat) n) (erased (List (Sy)) L R R2) (erased (Push K n R R2) pu)
